{"product_id":"rat-scabies-and-the-holy-grail","title":"Rat Scabies and the Holy Grail","description":"\u003cp\u003eChris Dawes lives in a quiet street in Brentford, opposite Rat Scabies, former drummer with The Damned and best noted for setting his drums on fire while playing them. Life with Rat as a neighbour isn't run-of-the-mill and things turn even stranger when Rat announces that the two of them are going on a search to find the Holy Grail. The sacred relic has eluded everyone from King Arthur to Monty Python, but Rat reckons he knows where it's stashed. Once they've written a list of things to do (\"Buy metal detectors!\") the pair get to work on unravelling the mystery, which involves the Knights Templar, the ancient sorcerer Kings of France, a shadowy secret society called the Priory of Sion, the CIA and the remote and spooky village of Rennes-le-Chateau in the Pyrenees, where it begins to look as though someone - or something - wants to stop them from finding out anything at all ...RAT SCABIES AND THE HOLY GRAIL is a psychedelic road trip, a rich historical yarn, and a testimony to the sometimes odd nature of certain friendships.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Christopher Dawes\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340832127\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45788201058457,"sku":"16RD-19780340832127","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ecd25ba6e59_Rat_Scabies_and_the_Holy_Grail_Christopher_Dawes__1.jpg?v=1760372341","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/rat-scabies-and-the-holy-grail","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}